Weak copyleft

  certifi            MPL-2.0              https://github.com/certifi/python-certifi
      httpx loads the CA bundle of certifi, unmodified. LangGraph also
      depends on httpx and certifi.

  psycopg, psycopg-binary, psycopg-pool    LGPL-3.0-only
      https://github.com/psycopg/psycopg

  hco-core uses psycopg unmodified, as the Postgres driver of SQLAlchemy and
  of the LangGraph checkpointer. Only the hco_core.db package and the
  hco_core.graphs.checkpointer module load it. You can replace it with a different
  build of psycopg 3 without a change to hco-core. The psycopg-binary wheel
  also contains libpq (PostgreSQL License) and OpenSSL (Apache-2.0).

